Flatulence accompanies many other complaints, as asthma and heart affections. Heaviness, full feeling and burning. Aversion to fat, to meat; to milk, which causes flatulence. Desire for coffee (which does not reheve); for acids; for sweet and salt things. Effects of alcohol; of fish, especially if tainted; ice- water; vegetables; salt or salt meats. Disorder from high living, and especially toifer-eating.

