8. Mouth. — Fetid breath, sometimes like garlic. — Ulcers on inner surAce of cheeks (painful when closing teeth). — Much mucus in mouth and throat. — Tongue coated white. — Painful soreness on chewing.— Great dryness of^mouth (and throat in morning) with violent thirst (for beer). o 0 . %roat.—Sore throat, With shooting pain during deglutition.— Swelling and ^eat dryness of throat. — Swelling of the submaxillary glands. — Rawness (stitching and burning) in pharynx, < on swallowing.— Tickling on swallowing, extending to car;- Dryness and burning in pharynx.— When swallowing the aliment rises towards nasal fossae. — Hawking up of mucus in morning.

