ughout body; cold feet with pricking; sensation as if she had put her cold feet into very hot water; then great heat. — Pam in hypogastrium and kidneys as before menstruation; lassitude in groins and top of thighs; pain with heat in sides almost with every breath. — Feeling in hypogastrium as if a hernia would protrude. — Heat in lower abdomen, < 1 .

